{"id":"n60293-2-8","stage":0,"title":"붙이다 · 挨","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60293-2-8-1","ko":"책장은 어디에 놓을까요?","zh":"书架放在哪里？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책장은","meaning":"书柜","explanation":"책장：书柜；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78697","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책장은","audio":"/audio/538284593804974d48e2.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"놓을까요?","meaning":"放置","explanation":"놓다：把书柜放到某个位置；-을까요 礼貌地询问对方意见。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓을까요","audio":"/audio/62b21ced431faf6c824a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0aedd7a678ca8a1d","term":"책장","zh":"书柜","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3","entryId":"78697","definition":"存放书籍的柜子。","pronunciation":["책짱"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把物品放在某处；本句问书柜放在哪里。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f238a0f92050979ee35.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60293-2-8-2","ko":"책상과 붙여서 놓아 주세요.","zh":"请紧挨着书桌放。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책상과","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；-과 标记贴靠的对象，책상과 붙여서 是“挨着书桌”。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","sen